z	can't wear these with sport shoulderpads (when pads worn under jersey)
z	can't wear these with sport shoulderpads on top
z	can't wear these with single shoulderpad right
z	can't wear these with single shoulderpad left
z	can't wear Jacket Suits with Sweaters, Sweater Hats or TorsoExtraVests or Cuirass
z	can't wear Jacket_Bulky or ItemBodyLocation.JACKET_HAT_BULKY with TorsoExtra or TorsoExtraVests or webbing or Cuirass
z	they're really the same body location, holster and webbing, but for hiding the model they need to be different
z	Can't wear skirt and pants.
z	Multi-item (for example: a dress) takes two slots.
z	Boilersuit (Coveralls) Can't wear with anything apart from head, and Bullet, hunting and high viz vests.
z	can't wear pants or skinny pants with short pants and pantsextra etc
z	can't wear PantsExtra with Sweater or SweaterHat
z	Can't wear Skirt and Dresses together
z	Multi-item (for example: longjohns) takes two slots.
z	can't wear Jackets and Jacket_Hats with Jacket_Bulky or ItemBodyLocation.JACKET_HAT_BULKY or JacketSuits or sweaters
z	can't wear neck textures with neck models (2d and 3d ties)
z	can't wear TorsoExtra with TorsoExtraVests
z	webbing can't be worn with fanny packs (+ it's better)
z	shin and knee armor
z	vambraces, can't wear vambraces and wrist watches or jewellery
z	Chainmail sleeves and single gloves aren't compatible with  each other
